    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "7421E4753FE5FE0F",
      "text": "牠恢復了嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "7421E5753FE5FFC2",
      "text": "牠比較內向？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_03",
      "hash64": "19F3424A1E12C056",
      "text": "嗯……怎麼說呢，牠是恢復活力了，\\n但或許牠的性格算是溫順？[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "3D325D92640E9D41",
      "text": "我也請米莫莎老師幫忙看過，\\n她說布撥牠的身體很健康～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "3D325A92640E9828",
      "text": "牠現在應該沒有受傷或生病\\n等等的異常才對呀～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_poke_02",
      "hash64": "B233D2EF13F66F65",
      "text": "…………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_04",
      "hash64": "19F3454A1E12C56F",
      "text": "是那樣沒錯，\\n但是這孩子就是不發出聲音……[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_05",
      "hash64": "19F3444A1E12C3BC",
      "text": "看來吉尼亞老師也摸不著頭緒。[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "3D325B92640E99DB",
      "text": "真抱歉我幫不上忙……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_06",
      "hash64": "19F3474A1E12C8D5",
      "text": "Never mind！\\n別在意！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_07",
      "hash64": "19F3464A1E12C722",
      "text": "學院的監視器有拍到……[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_08",
      "hash64": "19F3494A1E12CC3B",
      "text": "這孩子似乎是被野生的寶可夢攻擊，\\n結果逃到了學院裡面來。[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_09",
      "hash64": "19F3484A1E12CA88",
      "text": "或許那時候的記憶\\n讓牠很痛苦……\\r\\n所以現在不想開口？[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_poke_03",
      "hash64": "B233D1EF13F66DB2",
      "text": "…………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_10",
      "hash64": "19EFDB4A1E0FDB7A",
      "text": "嗯！那樣的話，\\n就算牠很安靜也完全ＯＫ，沒問題！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_11",
      "hash64": "19EFDC4A1E0FDD2D",
      "text": "直到牠想開口說話之前，\\n我會靜～靜等待，\\r\\n乖乖地wait就對了！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_12",
      "hash64": "19EFD94A1E0FD814",
      "text": "……就算懂得很多種語言，\\n在這世上還是有很多時候，\\r\\n無法摸透對方的心。[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_13",
      "hash64": "19EFDA4A1E0FD9C7",
      "text": "但是我不會灰心的。\\n我會等到彼此互相了解的那一天到來！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "90C28A31D82D201C",
      "text": "感受到了\\n賽吉老師的信賴！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
